  "prompt": "Create a premium cozy cooking-game full-screen background, ONE 256x256 opaque pixel-art atlas. This will be stretched to a 960x540 wide cooking HUD. The entire square is a muted dark espresso brown leather/wood background. Thin tasteful brass/sage border around the outer 4 pixels, tiny citrus emblem at (12,12), minimal woodgrain and warm corner lighting. Keep all interior pixels from x8..247,y25..239 dark and extremely quiet for text and interactable controls added later. NO letters, NO slots, NO grids, NO central ornaments. A restrained handcrafted kitchen game interface backing, not a Minecraft inventory GUI. Crisp grouped pixel shading, no noise.",
